---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout description="Mat 的 Agent 工程实践：上下文交接、运行观测、可靠恢复与工具权限。">
  <section class="home-hero site-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-kicker">DEVELOPER / BUILDER / LEARNER</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Less magic.<br /><em>More runtime.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">让 Agent 的任务交接更清楚，运行有据可查，<br class="desktop-break" />恢复与执行有明确边界。</p>
      <p class="hero-disciplines">CONTEXT <span>/</span> OBSERVABILITY <span>/</span> RECOVERY <span>/</span> PERMISSIONS</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-structure" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="structure-slab structure-slab-back"></div>
      <div class="structure-slab structure-slab-front"></div>
      <div class="structure-opening"></div>
      <span class="structure-caption">FORM FOLLOWS FUNCTION — 001</span>
    </div>
    <span class="hero-index" aria-hidden="true">01 / 03</span>
  </section>

  <aside class="now-strip site-shell" aria-label="Currently building">
    <span class="now-label">NOW</span>
    <span class="now-current"><span class="mint-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>ctxpack &amp; AgentLens</span>
    <span class="now-description">近期重点：任务交接与运行证据。<time datetime="2026-10-08">更新于 2026.10.08</time></span>
  </aside>

  <section class="work-section site-shell" id="work" aria-labelledby="selected-work">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="section-index">01 / WORK</p>
      <h2 id="selected-work">Selected work<span class="mint-period">.</span></h2>
      <p>从交接到执行，<br />把可靠性落在具体工具里。</p>
    </div>
    <article class="featured-project">
      <div class="featured-copy">
        <span class="project-number">01 / FEATURED PROJECT</span>
        <h3>ctxpack</h3>
        <p class="project-tagline">换一个会话，<br />接着把事情做完。</p>
        <p class="project-description">面向 Coding Agent 的本地上下文交接工具。保存目标、进度、决策与失败经验，核对 Git 快照，再生成下一位 Agent 能读懂的交接文档。</p>
        <p class="project-status">已发布 v0.1.0 · CLI / TUI</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/posts/ctxpack-handoff/">看一个交接示例 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="project-source" href="https://github.com/mat973252/ctxpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="architecture" role="img" aria-label="初始化、记录目标、采集快照、核对状态、生成交接文档">
        <span class="diagram-label">THE HANDOFF PATH</span>
        <ol>
          <li><span>01</span>Init</li>
          <li><span>02</span>Write context</li>
          <li><span>03</span>Capture</li>
          <li><span>04</span>Validate</li>
          <li><span>05</span>Handoff</li>
        </ol>
        <span class="diagram-foot">CONTEXT BEFORE CONTINUATION</span>
      </div>
      <p class="project-metadata">LOCAL FIRST <span>/</span> GIT SNAPSHOT <span>/</span> PORTABLE CONTEXT</p>
    </article>
    <div class="secondary-projects">
      <article class="secondary-project">
        <span class="project-number">02 / OBSERVABILITY</span>
        <div>
          <h3>AgentLens</h3>
          <p class="secondary-tagline">运行发生了什么，留下证据再判断。</p>
          <p>本地查看与对比 Agent 运行记录，从事件中检查失败与循环信号，为调试提供可追溯的依据。</p>
          <p class="project-status">已发布 v0.1.0 · 本地运行观测</p>
        </div>
        <a class="project-arrow" href="https://github.com/mat973252/agentlens" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 AgentLens">↗</a>
      </article>
      <article class="secondary-project">
        <span class="project-number">03 / RECOVERY</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Relay</h3>
          <p class="secondary-tagline">结果不确定时，先核对，再恢复。</p>
          <p>记录外部操作的执行状态，处理退出与恢复中的歧义。RelayMuse 是这条路线上的 Agent 实验案例。</p>
          <p class="project-status">已发布 v0.1.1 · 最新故障矩阵为本地实验</p>
          <a class="project-case" href="/posts/relay-recovery/">阅读恢复案例 ↗</a>
        </div>
        <a class="project-arrow" href="https://github.com/mat973252/Relay" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 Relay">↗</a>
      </article>
      <article class="secondary-project">
        <span class="project-number">04 / PERMISSIONS</span>
        <div>
          <h3>AgentPermit4j</h3>
          <p class="secondary-tagline">把执行权限放在工具调用之前。</p>
          <p>面向 Java / Spring AI 的动作执行层，在工具调用前落实授权、风险检查与审批，并提供幂等和审计。</p>
          <p class="project-status">已发布 v0.5.0 · Maven Central</p>
        </div>
        <a class="project-arrow" href="https://github.com/mat973252/agent-permit4j" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 AgentPermit4j">↗</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <details class="other-projects">
      <summary>其他项目 <span>检索质量与会话恢复</span></summary>
      <a href="https://github.com/mat973252/rag-contract4j" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RAGContract4j <span>检索、权限与引用的质量检查 · 实验项目 ↗</span></a>
      <a href="https://github.com/mat973252/claude-recovery-hooks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Recovery Hooks <span>Claude Code 瞬时故障恢复的 PowerShell 工具 ↗</span></a>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="post-section site-shell" id="notes" aria-labelledby="latest-posts">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="section-index">02 / NOTES</p>
      <h2 id="latest-posts">Field notes<span class="mint-period">.</span></h2>
      <p>具体的问题、做法，<br />以及证据能说明的范围。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="notes-columns" aria-hidden="true"><span>DATE</span><span>TITLE / DESCRIPTION</span><span>READ</span></div>
    <a class="note-entry" href="/posts/ctxpack-handoff/">
      <time datetime="2026-10-08">08 OCT 2026</time>
      <span class="note-content"><strong>ctxpack：让下一次会话接得上</strong><span>从目标记录到 Git 快照核对，一份可检查的交接文档如何生成。</span></span>
      <span class="note-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
    <a class="note-entry" href="/posts/relay-recovery/">
      <time datetime="2026-10-08">08 OCT 2026</time>
      <span class="note-content"><strong>Relay：请求之后，进程退出了</strong><span>一次真实 GitHub API 与客户端故障注入实验，观察 UNKNOWN 如何保持或被核对确认。</span></span>
      <span class="note-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
    <a class="note-entry" href="/posts/agent-anchor/">
      <time datetime="2026-08-30">30 AUG 2026</time>
      <span class="note-content"><strong>Agent 时代下的锚点</strong><span>从 Java 后端与企业知识检索实践出发，梳理 Agent 从 Demo 走向生产环境时不会轻易过时的八类工程能力。</span></span>
      <span class="note-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
